Acme’s round — what it means

Acme’s $20M Series A closed on Tuesday — a round led by Northwind Ventures.

The company said it will double its engineering team to 40 people by year end, and ship a hosted version of its build tool.

Existing investors Foundry Lane and Cedar Capital also participated in the round.
